ers" href="../sign-up" class="h_link color-inversion-target w-inline-block"><div class="h_txt">Registrieren</div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><section data-w-id="afedfe31-667c-c7b3-0247-375a5e7af9ae" class="hero_article"><div class="wrapper_article"><div class="article_box"><div><div class="tag_category"><div class="dot_dec black"></div><div class="tag_txt">Reisetipps</div></div></div><div class="article_headline_box"><h1 class="h1_article">Die besten Safaris, auf die man ein Leben lang zurückblickt</h1></div><div class="date_time"><div><div class="date_article">October 27, 2024</div></div><div class="read_time_box"><div class="read_time">6 mi</div><div class="read_time">read</div></div></div></div></div></section><section data-w-id="cafe7420-bb79-1c7e-c1a0-8b5be32c0a9b" class="section_parallax"><div class="fullsize_image"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/671e9ac7ff78b91a83dcc7f6_9.avif" loading="lazy" alt="Die besten Safaris, auf die man ein Leben lang zurückblickt" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/671e9ac7ff78b91a83dcc7f6_9-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/671e9ac7ff78b91a83dcc7f6_9.avif 1002w" class="image"/></div></section><section><div class="article_content"><div class="flex_article"><div class="voice_over"><a data-w-id="ddab0ff8-12df-a161-3538-2d6f1915d603" href="the-best-safaris-to-temember-for-a-lifetime#" class="voice_box w-inline-block"><div class="voice_first"><div class="voice_icon"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6713971095c4a7cab5d924ee/671d482bd7c1176b65d3fed6_listen.avif" loading="lazy" alt=""/></div><div class="listen_article start">Listen Article</div><div class="listen_article stop">Stop listening</div></div><div class="play_line"><div class="active_bar"></div><div class="passive_bar"></div></div></a></div><div class="content_article"><div class="description_box"><div class="description_first">Eine Safari ist viel mehr als nur ein Urlaub – sie ist ein Abenteuer, das dich mitten in die wilde Natur entführt und dir einzigartige Tierbegegnungen ermöglicht. Von den weiten Savannen Afrikas bis hin zu den dichten Regenwäldern Asiens bieten Safaris die Möglichkeit, majestätische Tiere in ihrem natürlichen Lebensraum zu erleben. In diesem Blogbeitrag zeigt dir Travel Next Level die besten Safari-Destinationen der Welt, die dir unvergessliche Erinnerungen bescheren werden. Buche deinen Traum-Safari-Urlaub ganz einfach über CHECK24 und genieße das ultimative Naturerlebnis.</div></div><div class="rich_part_1"><div class="w-richtext"><figure style="max-width:1600pxpx" class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image"><div><img loading="lazy" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/674c67b5f47212f0fe36e164_672b71e71bec4fbad6b6c4fe_672b71c1c8248d7e48144ddf_1.avif"/></div></figure><h2>1. Masai Mara, Kenya – The Home of the &quot;Big Five&quot;</h2><p>The <strong>Masai Mara</strong> in Kenya is one of the most famous safari destinations in the world. Here, you can observe the &quot;Big Five&quot;—lions, leopards, elephants, rhinoceroses, and buffaloes—in their natural habitat. Particularly spectacular is the annual <strong>Wildebeest Migration</strong>, where hundreds of thousands of wildebeests and zebras cross the Mara River.</p><h3>Recommended Hotels &amp; Resorts</h3><ul role="list"><li><strong>Angama Mara</strong>: This luxurious lodge offers breathtaking views of the Masai Mara and top-notch safari tours.</li><li><strong>Mara Serena Safari Lodge</strong>: Nestled in the reserve, this hotel is perfect for experiencing wildlife right at your doorstep.</li><li><strong>Sarova Mara Game Camp</strong>: A luxurious tented camp with comfortable accommodations and guided game drives.</li></ul><h3>Activities</h3><ol start="" role="list"><li>Game drives at sunrise and sunset.</li><li>Hot air balloon rides over the Masai Mara for a spectacular aerial view.</li><li>Visit a traditional Maasai village to learn more about Maasai culture.</li></ol><blockquote><a href="https://a.check24.net/misc/click.php?aid=18&amp;pid=788567&amp;target_url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.check24.net%2Fpauschalreisen-vergleich%2F%3Fc24pp_departure_date%3D2025-06-01%26c24pp_return_date%3D2025-06-15%26c24pp_travel_duration%3D2w%26c24pp_airport%3DBER%26c24pp_region_id%3D678%252C685%252C688%252C1008%26c24pp_county_id%3D58%26c24pp_adult%3D2%26c24pp_childrenCount%3D0%26c24pp_children_0%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_1%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_2%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_3%255Bage%255D%3D-%26pid%3D788567%23%2Fsuche%2Fhotel%3FcountryId%3D58%26extendedSearch%3D1%26sorting%3Drating%26pageArea%3Dpackage%26offerSort%3Ddefault%26areaSort%3Dtopregion%26airport%3DBER%26ds%3Dco%26transportType%3Dflight%26days%3D2w%26departureDate%3D2025-06-01%26returnDate%3D2025-06-15%26roomAllocation%3DA-A" target="_blank"><strong>Book your safari in Masai Mara here</strong><strong>: CHECK24 - Kenya Hotels</strong></a></blockquote><figure style="max-width:1600pxpx" class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image"><div><img loading="lazy" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/674c67b5f47212f0fe36e153_672b71e71bec4fbad6b6c4fb_672b71cacfeb9652456f55c3_2.avif"/></div></figure><h2>2. Kruger National Park, South Africa – One of the Oldest and Best Safari Destinations</h2><p>The <strong>Kruger National Park</strong> is one of the most renowned national parks in the world, offering spectacular safari experiences. With a vast array of wildlife, including the &quot;Big Five,&quot; crocodiles, giraffes, and wild dogs, this park is a must-visit for any safari enthusiast.</p><h3>Recommended Hotels &amp; Resorts</h3><ul role="list"><li><strong>Sabi Sabi Earth Lodge</strong>: One of the most luxurious lodges in the private Sabi Sands Game Reserve, which borders the Kruger National Park.</li><li><strong>Singita Lebombo Lodge</strong>: This lodge offers modern elegance and stunning views of the N’wanetsi River.</li><li><strong>Lion Sands River Lodge</strong>: A top-notch safari experience right on the riverbank, where animals regularly come to drink.</li></ul><h3>Activities</h3><ol start="" role="list"><li>Guided game drives in open 4x4 vehicles.</li><li>Night drives to spot nocturnal animals like leopards and hyenas.</li><li>Guided bush walks with experienced rangers.</li></ol><blockquote><a href="https://a.check24.net/misc/click.php?aid=18&amp;pid=788567&amp;target_url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.check24.net%2Fpauschalreisen-vergleich%2F%3Fc24pp_departure_date%3D2025-06-01%26c24pp_return_date%3D2025-06-15%26c24pp_travel_duration%3D2w%26c24pp_airport%3DBER%26c24pp_region_id%3D678%252C685%252C688%252C1008%26c24pp_county_id%3D58%26c24pp_adult%3D2%26c24pp_childrenCount%3D0%26c24pp_children_0%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_1%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_2%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_3%255Bage%255D%3D-%26pid%3D788567%23%2Fsuche%2Fhotel%3FcountryId%3D107%26extendedSearch%3D1%26sorting%3Drating%26pageArea%3Dpackage%26offerSort%3Ddefault%26areaSort%3Dtopregion%26airport%3DBER%26ds%3Dco%26transportType%3Dflight%26days%3D2w%26departureDate%3D2025-06-01%26returnDate%3D2025-06-15%26roomAllocation%3DA-A" target="_blank"><strong>Book your safari in Kruger National Park here: CHECK24 - South Africa Hotels</strong></a></blockquote><figure style="max-width:1600pxpx" class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image"><div><img loading="lazy" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/674c67b5f47212f0fe36e15a_672b71e71bec4fbad6b6c4f1_672b71d2cb7793071bbe4a43_3.avif"/></div></figure><h2>3. Serengeti, Tanzania – The Famous &quot;Endless Plain&quot;</h2><p>The <strong>Serengeti</strong> in Tanzania is world-renowned for its vast, open plains and spectacular wildlife. Here, you can witness the impressive <strong>Great Migration</strong>, where over 1.5 million wildebeests and hundreds of thousands of zebras and gazelles migrate from the Serengeti to the Masai Mara.</p><h3>Recommended Hotels &amp; Resorts</h3><ul role="list"><li><strong>Four Seasons Safari Lodge Serengeti</strong>: Luxurious suites with direct views of wildlife and an infinity pool overlooking a waterhole.</li><li><strong>Serengeti Serena Safari Lodge</strong>: A lodge built in traditional Maasai style, offering excellent game drives and birdwatching opportunities.</li><li><strong>Sayari Camp</strong>: An exclusive camp located in the northern Serengeti area, perfect for observing river crossings during the migration.</li></ul><h3>Activities</h3><ol start="" role="list"><li>Day and night safaris in open jeeps.</li><li>Hot air balloon rides over the vast plains of the Serengeti.</li><li>Visit to <strong>Olduvai Gorge</strong>, one of the most important prehistoric sites in human history.</li></ol><blockquote><a href="https://a.check24.net/misc/click.php?aid=18&amp;pid=788567&amp;target_url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.check24.net%2Fpauschalreisen-vergleich%2F%3Fc24pp_departure_date%3D2025-06-01%26c24pp_return_date%3D2025-06-15%26c24pp_travel_duration%3D2w%26c24pp_airport%3DBER%26c24pp_region_id%3D678%252C685%252C688%252C1008%26c24pp_county_id%3D58%26c24pp_adult%3D2%26c24pp_childrenCount%3D0%26c24pp_children_0%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_1%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_2%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_3%255Bage%255D%3D-%26pid%3D788567%23%2Fsuche%2Fhotel%3FcountryId%3D109%26extendedSearch%3D1%26sorting%3Drating%26pageArea%3Dpackage%26offerSort%3Ddefault%26areaSort%3Dtopregion%26airport%3DBER%26ds%3Dco%26transportType%3Dflight%26days%3D2w%26departureDate%3D2025-06-01%26returnDate%3D2025-06-15%26roomAllocation%3DA-A" target="_blank"><strong>Book your safari in the Serengeti here: CHECK24 - Tanzania Hotels</strong></a></blockquote><figure style="max-width:1600pxpx" class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image"><div><img loading="lazy" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/674c67b5f47212f0fe36e150_672b71e71bec4fbad6b6c4f8_672b71d615085b71e0ae7078_4.avif"/></div></figure><h2>4. Chobe National Park, Botswana – The Elephant Hotspot</h2><p>The <strong>Chobe National Park</strong> in Botswana is famous for its massive herds of elephants that gather along the <strong>Chobe River</strong>. In addition to classic jeep safaris, you can also enjoy a <strong>boat safari</strong>, allowing you to observe elephants, crocodiles, and hippos from the water.</p><h3>Recommended Hotels &amp; Resorts</h3><ul role="list"><li><strong>Chobe Game Lodge</strong>: The only hotel within the national park, offering stunning views of the Chobe River.</li><li><strong>Savute Safari Lodge</strong>: An exclusive camp located in the remote Savute region, perfect for spotting big cats.</li><li><strong>Muchenje Safari Lodge</strong>: This lodge provides top-notch safaris and is situated in the western region of the park.</li></ul><h3>Activities</h3><ol start="" role="list"><li>Boat safaris on the Chobe River with unique wildlife sightings.Day and night safaris in open jeeps.</li><li>Classic game drives to see elephants, lions, and other wildlife.</li><li>Visit the stunning <strong>Victoria Falls</strong>, just a short drive away.</li></ol><blockquote><a href="https://a.check24.net/misc/click.php?aid=18&amp;pid=788567&amp;target_url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.check24.net%2Fpauschalreisen-vergleich%2F%3Fc24pp_departure_date%3D2025-06-01%26c24pp_return_date%3D2025-06-15%26c24pp_travel_duration%3D2w%26c24pp_airport%3DBER%26c24pp_region_id%3D678%252C685%252C688%252C1008%26c24pp_county_id%3D58%26c24pp_adult%3D2%26c24pp_childrenCount%3D0%26c24pp_children_0%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_1%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_2%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_3%255Bage%255D%3D-%26pid%3D788567%23%2Fsuche%2Fhotel%3FareaId%3D1164%26hotelId%3D1079141%26extendedSearch%3D1%26sorting%3DcategoryDistribution%26pageArea%3Dpackage%26offerSort%3Ddefault%26areaSort%3Dtopregion%26airport%3DBER%26dhs%3D1079141%26ds%3Dh%26transportType%3Dflight%26days%3D2w%26departureDate%3D2025-06-01%26returnDate%3D2025-06-15%26roomAllocation%3DA-A" target="_blank"><strong>Book your safari in Chobe National Park here: CHECK24 - Botswana Hotels</strong></a></blockquote><figure style="max-width:1600pxpx" class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image"><div><img loading="lazy" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/674c67b5f47212f0fe36e156_672b71e71bec4fbad6b6c4ed_672b71ddb3b3f2b3022e2ab6_5.avif"/></div></figure><h2>5. Okavango Delta, Botswana – A Unique Natural Wonder</h2><p>The <strong>Okavango Delta</strong> in Botswana is one of the most extraordinary natural paradises in the world. Here, the Okavango River flows inland, creating a vast swamp area where you can observe hippos, elephants, buffalo, and numerous bird species. The delta is particularly known for its <strong>mokoro tours</strong>—traditional canoe rides that allow you to experience wildlife up close.</p><h3>Recommended Hotels &amp; Resorts</h3><ul role="list"><li><strong>Belmond Eagle Island Lodge</strong>: A luxurious lodge in the heart of the delta, perfect for safaris and mokoro rides.</li><li><strong>Vumbura Plains Camp</strong>: A luxurious camp offering top-notch wildlife viewing both on land and in water.</li><li><strong>Chief’s Camp</strong>: This exclusive camp is located in one of the best wildlife viewing areas of the delta.</li></ul><h3>Activities</h3><ol start="" role="list"><li>Mokoro tours through the delta.</li><li>Guided safaris on foot or in 4x4 vehicles.</li><li>Birdwatching with over 400 species to spot.</li></ol><blockquote><a href="https://a.check24.net/misc/click.php?aid=18&amp;pid=788567&amp;target_url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.check24.net%2Fpauschalreisen-vergleich%2F%3Fc24pp_departure_date%3D2025-06-01%26c24pp_return_date%3D2025-06-15%26c24pp_travel_duration%3D2w%26c24pp_airport%3DBER%26c24pp_region_id%3D678%252C685%252C688%252C1008%26c24pp_county_id%3D58%26c24pp_adult%3D2%26c24pp_childrenCount%3D0%26c24pp_children_0%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_1%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_2%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_3%255Bage%255D%3D-%26pid%3D788567%23%2Fsuche%2Fhotel%3FareaId%3D1164%26hotelId%3D76516%26extendedSearch%3D1%26sorting%3DcategoryDistribution%26pageArea%3Dpackage%26offerSort%3Ddefault%26areaSort%3Dtopregion%26airport%3DBER%26dhs%3D76516%26ds%3Dh%26transportType%3Dflight%26days%3D2w%26departureDate%3D2025-06-01%26returnDate%3D2025-06-15%26roomAllocation%3DA-A" target="_blank"><strong>Book your safari in the Okavango Delta here: CHECK24 - Botswana Hotels</strong></a></blockquote><figure style="max-width:1600pxpx" class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image"><div><img loading="lazy" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/674c67b5f47212f0fe36e160_672b71e71bec4fbad6b6c501_672b71e3674aa2c0f6a84c3c_6.avif"/></div></figure><h2>6. Yala National Park, Sri Lanka – Leopard Safari in Asia</h2><p><strong>Yala National Park</strong> in Sri Lanka is renowned for its high density of leopards, making it the best place in the world to observe these majestic predators in the wild. The park is also home to elephants, crocodiles, bears, and an incredible variety of bird species.</p><h3>Recommended Hotels &amp; Resorts</h3><ul role="list"><li><strong>Jetwing Yala</strong>: A luxurious eco-resort located right at the edge of the park, perfect for wildlife observation.</li><li><strong>Wild Coast Tented Lodge</strong>: This exclusive, safari-inspired lodge offers luxury amidst the wilderness.</li><li><strong>Chena Huts by Uga Escapes</strong>: An exclusive lodge with luxurious huts providing unique wildlife experiences.</li></ul><h3>Activities</h3><ol start="" role="list"><li>Leopard safaris in Yala National Park.</li><li>Birdwatching and crocodile sightings in the river areas.</li><li>Relaxation on the pristine beaches of the region.</li></ol><blockquote><a href="https://a.check24.net/misc/click.php?aid=18&amp;pid=788567&amp;target_url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.check24.net%2Fpauschalreisen-vergleich%2F%3Fc24pp_departure_date%3D2025-06-01%26c24pp_return_date%3D2025-06-15%26c24pp_travel_duration%3D2w%26c24pp_airport%3DBER%26c24pp_region_id%3D678%252C685%252C688%252C1008%26c24pp_county_id%3D58%26c24pp_adult%3D2%26c24pp_childrenCount%3D0%26c24pp_children_0%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_1%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_2%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_3%255Bage%255D%3D-%26pid%3D788567%23%2Fsuche%2Fhotel%3FcountryId%3D105%26extendedSearch%3D1%26sorting%3Drating%26pageArea%3Dpackage%26offerSort%3Ddefault%26areaSort%3Dtopregion%26airport%3DBER%26ds%3Dco%26transportType%3Dflight%26days%3D2w%26departureDate%3D2025-06-01%26returnDate%3D2025-06-15%26roomAllocation%3DA-A" target="_blank"><strong>Book your safari in Sri Lanka here: CHECK24 - Sri Lanka Hotels</strong></a></blockquote></div></div><div class="rich_part_2"><div class="w-richtext"><h2>Conclusion</h2><p>A safari is the ultimate adventure for nature lovers and animal enthusiasts. Whether in the vast plains of the Serengeti, the dense forests of Sri Lanka, or the river landscapes of Botswana, these breathtaking experiences leave lasting impressions. With <strong>Travel Next Level</strong> and <strong>CHECK24</strong>, you can easily book your dream safari and discover the best resorts and hotels that offer unforgettable encounters with wildlife.</p></div></div><div class="rich_part_3 w-condition-invisible"><div class="w-dyn-bind-empty w-richtext"></div></div><div class="rich_part_4 w-condition-invisible"><div class="w-dyn-bind-empty w-richtext"></div></div></div><div class="socials_share"><div class="social_flex"><a fs-socialshare-element="facebook" href="the-best-safaris-to-temember-for-a-lifetime#" class="social_icon w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6713971095